   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "SC2208B",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**SC2208B** · fact\n\nd=79 cells w=0..7 are already implied by OEIS rows A000045 (a(m+2)), A001333 (a(m+1)), A051736, A051737, A089936-8 (a(m)); all 7 equal run-1754 values. Novelty claim must say 'first full row; w<=7 agree with existing row sequences'. No row sequence for w>=8",
