   "text": "✗ **SC2208C** · dead\n\nsettled-check: look for A089980 d=79 in GitHub/Zenodo/stat-phys/SeqFan — 0 repo hits (control 858), Zenodo irrelevant, web search only OEIS+Liang; code search 401",
