   "type": "text",
   "text": "**L2208** · lead\n\np2 antidiag-79 TODO: harvest jobs ad79-far-w35/-w36 and compare; finish w=37..39 hs_mod (<=2 jobs in parallel at w>=37 under swap pressure; rerun TIMEOUT j13-16); far.py w=37..39 as queued jobs; then claim/ + 3-skeptic panel. Novelty wording: cells w<=7 implied by published row sequences",
